<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: "20px 72px", background: "#F5E3BE", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 122, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>原理 · 五子棋 VCF / VCT 算杀</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 10 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.62)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginTop: 8 }}>把「我能不能必胜」变成一棵 AND-OR 树的枚举问题，而不是靠评估分猜</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 510, flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: "100%", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", height: "100%", gap: 30, alignItems: "center" }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 520, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 10, alignItems: "center" }}>
    <svg width="430" height="280" viewBox="0 0 430 280" style={{ background: "rgba(140,90,43,0.06)", borderRadius: 10, maxWidth: "100%", height: "auto" }}>
      <rect x="185" y="18" width="70" height="40" rx="8" fill="#B3271E"/><text x="220" y="43" font-size="14" fill="#F5E3BE" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">攻·冲四</text>
      <rect x="85" y="110" width="70" height="40" rx="8" fill="#2A2118"/><rect x="285" y="110" width="70" height="40" rx="8" fill="#2A2118"/>
      <text x="120" y="135" font-size="13" fill="#F5E3BE" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">守·堵A</text><text x="320" y="135" font-size="13" fill="#F5E3BE" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">守·堵B</text>
      <rect x="35" y="210" width="70" height="40" rx="8" fill="#8C5A2B"/><rect x="195" y="210" width="70" height="40" rx="8" fill="#8C5A2B"/><rect x="335" y="210" width="70" height="40" rx="8" fill="#8C5A2B"/>
      <text x="70" y="235" font-size="12" fill="#F5E3BE" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">胜</text><text x="230" y="235" font-size="12" fill="#F5E3BE" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">胜</text><text x="370" y="235" font-size="12" fill="#F5E3BE" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">胜</text>
      <line x1="210" y1="58" x2="125" y2="110" stroke="#8C5A2B" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="230" y1="58" x2="315" y2="110" stroke="#8C5A2B" stroke-width="2"/>
      <line x1="110" y1="150" x2="70" y2="210" stroke="#B3271E" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="140" y1="150" x2="225" y2="210" stroke="#B3271E" stroke-width="2"/>
      <line x1="300" y1="150" x2="230" y2="210" stroke="#B3271E" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="330" y1="150" x2="370" y2="210" stroke="#B3271E" stroke-width="2"/>
    </svg>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.6)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>攻方是「或」节点（任一成五即胜），守方是「与」节点（须堵住全部威胁）</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 6 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.8)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>VCF 只算「连续冲四」的强制序列，深度可控、速度快。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.8)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>VCT 允许活三，树更大但能抓到更隐蔽的杀。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.8)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>MIN 层只生成堵点，不给守方生成无用着法，树宽被有效收窄。</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", background: "rgba(42,33,24,0.94)", borderLeft: "5px solid #B3271E", borderRadius: 6, padding: "10px 20px", marginTop: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(245,227,190,0.92)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>这就是「算杀」与「评估」的分工：评估分说谁好，算杀直接证明谁赢。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 48, flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "space-between" }}>
